            "detailed_description": "InFlux is a puzzle game that mixes exploration and platforming in a series of beautiful natural and abstract environments. You are a mysterious metal sphere which falls from the sky, traversing an apparently deserted island dotted with cubic structures of glass and steel. Each glasshouse is a puzzle to be solved.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sit in a comfy chair and become as relaxed as you have ever been while playing a video game <br></li><li>Solve a series of mind-bending cubic puzzle structures connected by... <br></li><li>A series of beautiful, naturalistic hub world environments to roll around <br></li><li>Meet a majestic and enigmatic humpback whale <br></li><li>Works great with keyboard and mouse or your Xbox 360 controller <br></li><li>A completely original soundtrack by musical genius Jonathan Yandel</li></ul>",
